          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon MediaStore Put Lifecycle Policy",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Writes an object lifecycle policy to a container. If the container already has an object lifecycle policy, the service replaces the existing policy with the new policy. It takes up to 20 minutes for the change to take effect.</p> <p>For information about how to construct an object lifecycle policy, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/mediastore/latest/ug/policies-object-lifecycle-components.html\">Components of an Object Lifecycle Policy</a>.</p>",
